## Credits / third-party references

- Implementation: **DeepSeek**.
- [UnrealUI](https://github.com/getunreal/unreal-ui) (MIT) — the widget/frame
  mechanics are adapted from its `core/style.lua` and `core/widgets.lua`: flat
  fill backdrops, explicit 1 px borders drawn as textures, the drag-thumb
  slider, and the no-EditBox value readout.
- [ElvUI](https://github.com/tukui-org/ElvUI) — the color palette is borrowed
  from ElvUI's default theme (dark panels, thin borders, `#FFD100` accent).
